  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "'Sup guys. So with the new update came a feature that plopped \"Popular Worlds\" in the social list.. I feel like this is really unnecessary as most people have already been to these worlds before. \n\nWhy not replace Popular Worlds with New Worlds instead? It feels like the New Worlds list is far down the Worlds List and nobody really ever goes to it. It'd be great for new content creators to get a bit of exposure, everyone has been to the PUG, Open Mic Night, Gaia Night, etc. At this point it's really just another tab that we don't need to see. I'd love if it was changed to New Worlds, though. Idk, was just a thought!",
